### Service orders - Open weighted service order
# @name openWeightedServiceOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/service-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{issueToken.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{createCustomer.response.body.$.id}}",
  "vehicleId": "{{createVehicle.response.body.$.id}}",
  "description": "OS de teste para rateio ponderado"
}

### Service orders - Receive the weighted service order
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/service-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{issueToken.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceOrderId": "{{openWeightedServiceOrder.response.body.$.id}}",
  "checkList": "Inspecao inicial concluida"
}

### Service orders - Start diagnosis by assigning a mechanic
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/service-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{issueToken.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceOrderId": "{{openWeightedServiceOrder.response.body.$.id}}",
  "mechanicId": "{{createMechanic.response.body.$.id}}"
}

### Service orders - Associate services and request approval
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/service-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{issueToken.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceOrderId": "{{openWeightedServiceOrder.response.body.$.id}}",
  "workshopServiceIds": [
    "{{createWeightedServiceA.response.body.$.id}}",
    "{{createWeightedServiceB.response.body.$.id}}"
  ]
}

